# PHP releases past their end of life that Short Leash still installs on
# macOS. PHP 8.0 and 8.1 get no more releases, so nothing is built for them:
# php-repackaged.sh releases static-php-cli's own builds of each minor's last
# release unchanged, so Short Leash serves the same programs people already
# run from its own downloads.
#
# dl.static-php.dev publishes no checksums, so each archive is pinned here by
# the SHA-256 it had on 2026-11-17, and a file that differs is refused. One
# release is built once: plan.py leaves out a version whose files are all on
# its release already.
#
# These are upstream's builds as they are. Their extensions are static-php-cli's
# bulk set, not php-extensions.txt, and 8.0.30 for Apple silicon needs
# macOS 14 (every other file runs on macOS 13).
PHP_REPACKAGED=8.0.30 8.1.34
PHP_REPACKAGED_FROM=https://dl.static-php.dev/static-php-cli/bulk
PHP_8_0_30_CLI_AARCH64_SHA256=13c77c837cd50c027e1c614c192b25205123311a30d2335e9a3c8f82d23acb9a
PHP_8_0_30_FPM_AARCH64_SHA256=e91bc2624c4469ceb0d7f7d93d643e1aebadd451556b0b1cc8d5142531b14138
PHP_8_0_30_CLI_X86_64_SHA256=b025f2c343916dd97d4cad543f0cc4c07ac882af10bc72773ad27ab8f6c9f59a
PHP_8_0_30_FPM_X86_64_SHA256=ec02cd54162c190c0029ddccbc382e21442b4941aedef9455b8d6fd32bc472d5
PHP_8_1_34_CLI_AARCH64_SHA256=b721271659d6e3448c29c0dc5755ffc4b8a1498c4709e1aba6602cfb584a84e4
PHP_8_1_34_FPM_AARCH64_SHA256=c5faad9eac5ce9753c30a17fb2a2023dcf72e5b367e0ac76b81d006647ea0e52
PHP_8_1_34_CLI_X86_64_SHA256=5fe69256365f96a270e34208ec574be7012c8c08a23bdf52948d0d16d4d8ec6a
PHP_8_1_34_FPM_X86_64_SHA256=eab87df298d83c8182f296e3f56ac4025cdb2a74baa4b6587d27ea39ac31b5e6
